# EVIDENCE/<utc-ts>/register.json captures a real registered tenant's
# basic-auth secret. Even though these are short-lived synthetic
# tenants on community-saas, the credential is valid until the row is
# revoked. Never commit register.json into the public-mirrored repo.
# Test logic falls back to the env-vars path (TENANT/SECRET) when
# present, so re-running the test from cached creds is the canonical
# iterative-dev path.
EVIDENCE/*/register.json
